# This folder is the working project. Only the finished deliverables are
# published: the two manuals and the three firmware images. Everything else,
# the tooling, the notes, the extracted tables, the manual build sources and
# the manufacturer's own documents, stays local.
#
# The rule below ignores everything and then names the exceptions, so a new
# file is private by default and has to be added here deliberately.

/*

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE

!docs/
docs/*
!docs/34420A_Users_Manual.pdf
!docs/34420A_Technical_Service_Manual.pdf
!docs/34420A_Schematics.pdf

!firmware/
firmware/*
!firmware/*.bin
